        "fix: [taal] in 'terug waar iemand pas baklei': 'Gaan terug waar' leaves the destination without its preposition, which reads elliptically.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'Iets wat iemand vat om 'n ander mens mee seer te maak': 'Vat ... mee' is informal and a bit wooden for a definition.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Geweld hoort nie by sekere mense of by sekere plekke nie.': 'Hoort nie by' reads as 'violence is not proper for certain people', while the block seems to mean violence is not limited to certain people or places (and places take 'op', not 'by'); fixing it means guessing whether 'net' is intended, which adds a qualifier, so it goes to the writer.",
