  "taal_vir_skrywer": [
    "fix: [taal] in 'Geweld hoort nie by sekere mense of by sekere plekke nie': 'Geweld hoort nie by sekere mense of by sekere plekke nie' is vague and can read as 'violence does not suit certain people', and 'by sekere plekke' wants 'op'",
    "fix: [taal] in 'soos 'n klaskamer met 'n onderwyser of 'n winkel': 'soos 'n klaskamer met 'n onderwyser of 'n winkel' can briefly read as a classroom with a teacher or with a shop",
    "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Wanneer iemand 'n ander mens aspris seermaak of op die punt staan om d': A noun is defined with a 'wanneer' clause; '’n Situasie waarin iemand ...' would be the proper form. Not proposed as a change because the same words, differing only in case, also stand in the first study block, so the 'voor' would not be unique."
  ],
