  "taal_vir_mens": [
    "[taal, protected word] 'om te wen of terug te kry nie': 'Iemand terugkry' for revenge is colloquial and close to English 'get someone back'; 'terugkry' normally means 'get something back'. 'Om te wen of wraak te neem' would be clearer, but the wording is protected, so left for a person to decide."
  ],
